OL,3,GFEATURESCReflections on 50th
OL,4,Canniversary of BBC TV News presentation
OL,5,Cupdate
OL,6,
OL,7,FSomething of a back to basics revamp of
OL,8,FBBC News took place exactly 50 years
OL,9,Fago this week.
OL,11,FChanges to the Nine o'Clock News made
OL,12,Fin 1972 were abandoned.
OL,14,FIt was goodbye to the use of two
OL,15,Fpresenters and a superimposed newsroom
OL,16,Fbackground which, to modern eyes at
OL,17,Fleast, looks both cluttered and quite
OL,18,Famateurish.
OL,23,APub: 08-Mar-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12102
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1772999460
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCReflections on 50th
OL,4,Canniversary of BBC TV News presentation
OL,5,Cupdate
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe same newsreader was scheduled for
OL,8,Fall three main BBC One bulletins each
OL,9,Fday to try to give a greater sense of
OL,10,Fcontinuity.
OL,12,FA conscious effort was made to keep the
OL,13,Fvisual style as simple as possible `
OL,14,Fboth in terms of storytelling technique
OL,15,Fand the avoidance of visual gimmicks.
OL,23,APub: 08-Mar-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12103
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1772999460
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCReflections on 50th
OL,4,Canniversary of BBC TV News presentation
OL,5,Cupdate
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere were also a few purely cosmetic
OL,8,Fchanges. These included a new
OL,9,Fbackground behind the newsreader ` a
OL,10,Fwarmer wooden brown replaced the grey
OL,11,Fpanels seen on shorter bulletins since
OL,12,F1970.
OL,14,FThere were also changes to the names of
OL,15,Fprogrammes but these should not be
OL,16,Foverstated.
OL,23,APub: 08-Mar-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
