OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCReflections on 50th
OL,4,Canniversary of BBC TV News presentation
OL,5,Cupdate
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe lunchtime news, which had been
OL,8,Fextended to 15 minutes a few weeks
OL,9,Fearlier, became known as the Midday
OL,10,FNews. Previously it had no programme
OL,11,Ftitle.
OL,13,FThe 5.45pm bulletin, billed in Radio
OL,14,FTimes as the National News to
OL,15,Fdistinguish it from the regional news
OL,16,Fwhich followed but not branded with
OL,17,Fthis title on air, took up the name
OL,18,FEvening News. It was brought forward to
OL,19,F5.40pm six months later when ITN
OL,20,Flaunched the News at 5.45.
OL,23,APub: 08-Mar-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12105
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1772999460
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCReflections on 50th
OL,4,Canniversary of BBC TV News presentation
OL,5,Cupdate
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe interesting thing about these
OL,8,Fchanges was that they seemed to be
OL,9,Fflowing against the tide.
OL,11,FWas too much attention being paid to
OL,12,Fthe pictures themselves at the expense
OL,13,Fof clear storytelling?
OL,15,FRemember this was an era before
OL,16,FElectronic News Gathering (ENG) was in
OL,17,Fuse and years before computer graphics.
OL,19,FFilm had to be processed and developed.
OL,23,APub: 08-Mar-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12106
SC,0006
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1772999460
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G6/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCReflections on 50th
OL,4,Canniversary of BBC TV News presentation
OL,5,Cupdate
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe changes split Radio Times readers.
OL,8,FSome welcomed them, others saw them as
OL,9,Fa step backwards.
OL,11,FToday lightweight equipment, advanced
OL,12,Fcomputer graphics, satellite and the
OL,13,Finternet make it immeasurably easier to
OL,14,Ftry to make the news visually
OL,15,Finteresting.
OL,17,FBut these tools can never be a
OL,18,Freplacement for clear writing, accuracy
OL,19,Fand good storytelling.
OL,23,APub: 08-Mar-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
