OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCReflections on 50th
OL,4,Canniversary of BBC TV News presentation
OL,5,Cupdate
OL,6,
OL,7,FFashions come and go. Individual
OL,8,Feditors have preferences.
OL,10,FBut the building blocks of the best TV
OL,11,Fpackaging are timeless.
OL,13,FModern technology should make it easier
OL,14,Fto harness the power of a visual medium
OL,15,Fto tell the day's news clearly without
OL,16,Feither resorting to gimmickry or ruling
OL,17,Fout important material because it could
OL,18,Fbe dull TV.
OL,23,APub: 08-Mar-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
